# Architecture & Riverpod Rules

## Feature-First Clean Architecture

```
lib/
├── core/
│   ├── constants/       # App constants, category keywords
│   ├── theme/           # Material 3 theme & color schemes
│   ├── utils/           # Currency & date formatters
│   └── widgets/         # Shared app-wide widgets
├── features/
│   ├── camera/          # Camera preview & crop overlay
│   ├── ocr/             # ML Kit text recognition & parser logic
│   ├── review/          # OCR review & receipt edit screen
│   ├── transaction/     # Models, DB helper, Expense repository
│   ├── history/         # Expense history, search, and category filters
│   └── dashboard/       # Spending analytics & CustomPainters
```

## Layer Boundaries & Data Rules
1. **Domain & Data Layer**: `Expense` model, `ParsedReceipt`, `DatabaseHelper`, `ExpenseRepository`.
2. **Services**: ML Kit OCR text recognition service and regex heuristic parser.
3. **Presentation Layer**: Screen widgets and Riverpod state controllers.
4. **Offline & Security**: All image processing and OCR happen on-device. No remote API calls or keys required.
